- [x] [Vector Tuning](prd/vector-tuning.md) — RESOLVED via pretrained embedding. Owner A/B (11 seeds) showed DSP reweighting (balancing/timbre-forward/key-invariance) all trade one error for another — a representation ceiling, not a calibration problem. Fix: PANNs CNN14 2048-dim audio embedding (migration 0016 `track_vectors_embed`; indexer app/embeddings.py; ~2.5s/track CPU). Demolished the false matches (Dragonfly→Scream #1→#178, In Flames→Evalyn #4→#1775). **Now the DEFAULT similarity space** (`?space=embed`); standard/ki DSP spaces (migrations 0015/0016) kept as dev-only fallback; Sound Matching sliders retired from UI. Radio ripple-mode geometry still needs retuning for embed's compressed cosine band (follow-up). Music Map still on DSP vectors.
